import H0mework.Physics.GaugeAction.P286GaugeConnectionVariation

/-!
# S9-C3a2: local action variation of the primitive P286 connection

The primitive variation and all three generated charged jets come from
`StageNineP286GaugeConnectionVariation`.  This module substitutes those
outputs into the one common Stage-9 local density and proves its exact
quadratic expansion.  The helper point field below is a readout used only to
state that substitution; it is not a new action or source mouth.
-/

